+
+In [Python mode](../concepts/serialization.md#python-mode), [`datetime`][datetime.datetime] instances are
+serialized as is.
+
+In [JSON mode](../concepts/serialization.md#json-mode), they are serialized as strings.
+
+<h4>Constraints</h4>
